    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40878" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-gĕmo</span></b> ,
			ĕre, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to resound with
			sighs</i> or <i>groans</i> (perh. only in the foll.
			passages): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">abjunctis regemunt tabulata cavernis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 5, 389</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regemunt lacus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
